## Decision honesty

**FIXED path-A for HIGH 7.10 (`c_parse_secret_env`):**

Parser is defined in `ooda/oodac/c_emit_secret.oo` (264 lines). After
line-start `// SECRET:` needle + space skip, the ident walk advances
`k` with `char_at` for class only, then **one**
`str_slice(src, start, k)` for the name. There is no
`name = name + c` / per-char OoStr concat in `c_parse_secret_env`.
`.oo` has no C `char buf[N]`; the alpha honesty for the SPRINT
“char-by-char leak” wording is **slice-once-per-ident** (same close as
7.1 / 7.2 / `t1_memory.oot` M-SG*).

Live prove: `scripts/s710_parse_secret_env_smoke.sh` **ALL OK**
(fail-closed SECRET IDENT println; two-name both refuse; empty name
invalid). T1/T2 secret smokes that parse `// SECRET:` remain exit 0.
7.1 / 7.2 dedicated smokes remain exit 0 (not reopened).

**Not ALREADY_FIXED:** Domain A rewrote the ident accumulate this wave.
Product host ELF was **not** rebuilt (named residual below).

**Still not claimed (do not greenwash):**

| Residual | Status |
|----------|--------|
| Product `oodac/oodac` **962960** B @ 07:49 | **stale** — ELF `c_parse_secret_env` still `oo_str_concat`×2+, **0** `oo_str_slice`; next seed/pure-multi picks up source |
| **8.6** `c_args_strip_cr` `out = out + c` | other OWN — not parse-env |
| `char_at` 1-byte `OoStr` temps while walking | language floor — not quadratic ident leak |
| `__sec__` + name / needle `"// "+"SECRET:"` | O(1) per directive / once — not the leak |
| Shared `c_slice_ident_at` helper | not landed (ideas I1 inlined instead) |
| Leading-digit SECRET names | pre-existing `is_al` includes `0–9` at start |
| Full IFC / `#[Secret]` / interp `${}` | residual (named in harness + ideas) |
| `ci_product.sh` does not wire s710 (or s71/s72) | hygiene residual — T1/T2 only |
| s71/s72/s710 smoke residual **banners** | still print “7.10 concat” — scripts not rewritten this close |
| `s710_integration.oot` OPEN/SKIP snapshot | **stale** — landed before DE slice + harness smoke; Docs Writer re-prove supersedes those two rows |
| 2.10 `__sec_sink__` prefix scan | concurrent dirty hunk (+5 L250–254) — **not** 7.10 |

Path-A 7.10 ≠ C stack buffer rewrite.
Cap preferred style: source slice + smoke green + named residual = FIXED path-A.

